отом по земле, оглушая врагов перед собой и нанося им урон.","desc_en":"Dawnbreaker whirls her hammer around 3 times, damaging enemies with her attack plus bonus damage. On the final strike, she smashes her hammer down, stunning and damaging enemies in front of her.","notes_ru":["Под действием этой способности герой передвигается со скоростью 215, а на восстановление после последнего взмаха ему требуется 0.2 сек.","Под действием этой способности нельзя применять Celestial Hammer или Solar Guardian.","На атаки этой способностью не действует прорубание.","Можно применить на себя, чтобы передвигаться вперёд.","Два первых взмаха на 0.12s сек. замедляют передвижение врагов на -100%."],"notes_en":["Dawnbreaker travels at a rate of 215 for the duration of the ability and takes a brief 0.2s to recover after the final strike.","Celestial Hammer or Solar Guardian cannot be cast during the combo.","Cleave does not work with this ability.","Can be self-cast to move forward.","The first two strikes will slow enemy movement speed by -100% for 0.12s."],"specials":[{"key":"duration","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДЛИТЕЛЬНОСТЬ:","heading_en":"COMBO DURATION:","values":[1.1],"percent":false},{"key":"swipe_radius","system":false,"heading_ru":"РАДИУС ВЗМАХОВ И УДАРА:","heading_en":"SWIPE/SMASH RADIUS:","values":[300.0],"percent":false},{"key":"swipe_damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДОП. УРОН ОТ ВЗМАХОВ И УДАРА:","heading_en":"SWIPE/SMASH BONUS DAMAGE:","values":[25.0,40.0,55.0,70.0],"percent":false},{"key":"smash_radius","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[300.0],"percent":false},{"key":"smash_damage","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[25.0,40.0,55.0,70.0],"percent":false},{"key":"movement_speed","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[215.0],"percent":false},{"key":"total_attacks","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[3.0],"percent":false},{"key":"smash_stun_duration","system":false,"headi