,"name_en":"Luminosity","kind":"basic","innate":false,"granted_by_scepter":false,"granted_by_shard":false,"max_level":4,"behavior":["passive"],"behavior_ru":["пассивная"],"target_team":["friendly"],"target_type":[],"target_flags":[],"damage_type":null,"bkb_pierce":true,"immunity_code":1,"immunity":"allies_yes","dispellable":null,"cooldown":[],"mana_cost":[],"health_cost":[],"gold_cost":[],"cast_range":[],"cast_point":[],"channel_time":[],"duration":[],"desc_ru":"Совершив несколько атак, герой преисполняется мощью: следующая его атака станет критической и излечит его и союзных героев в радиусе 650 на долю от нанесённого урона. Лечение от атаки по крипу или нейтральному существу будет слабее. Союзникам даётся только 50% лечения.","desc_en":"After a number of attacks, Dawnbreaker powers up, charging her next attack with a critical hit that heals all allied heroes within 650 units around her for a portion of attack damage dealt. Creeps and neutral enemies provide less healing. Allies are healed for 50% of the amount.","notes_ru":["Лечение от этой способности увеличивается усилением пополнения здоровья.","Получение эффектов отключается истощением."],"notes_en":["Luminosity Heal is increased by sources of Health Restoration Amplification.","Break disables the gaining of new stacks."],"specials":[{"key":"attack_count","system":false,"heading_ru":"АТАК ДЛЯ СРАБАТЫВАНИЯ:","heading_en":"ATTACKS REQUIRED:","values":[3.0],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_dawnbreaker_luminosity_attack_count","level":20,"op":"subtract","value":1,"values_with":[2.0]}]},{"key":"heal_radius","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[650.0],"percent":false},{"key":"heal_pct","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЛЕЧЕНИЕ ОТ АТАКИ ПО ГЕРОЮ:","heading_en":"HEALING FROM HEROES:","values":[35.0,40.0,45.0,50.0],"percent":true},{"key":"heal_from_creeps","system":false,"heading_ru":"УМЕНЬШЕНИЕ ЛЕЧЕНИЯ ОТ КРИПОВ:","heading_en":"CREEP HEAL PENALTY:","values":[40.0],"percent"