аждая пульсация наносит урон врагам и излечивает союзников.\nПосле небольшой подготовки герой летит в указанную область, при приземлении нанося врагам дополнительный урон и оглушая их.\nНачав применение этой способности, её нельзя прервать.","desc_en":"CHANNELED - Dawnbreaker creates a pulsing effect at a location within 350 units of an allied hero anywhere on the map and creates daylight for 6s. Each pulse damages enemies and heals allies.\nAfter a short duration, she flies to the target location and deals additional damage and stuns enemies upon landing.\nOnce channeled, Dawnbreaker cannot stop the ability.","notes_ru":["Интервал пульсаций составляет 0.5 сек.","Всего на перемещение уходит 1.7 сек. применения способности и 0.8 сек. полёта.","Применение этой способности мгновенно возвращает молот к владельцу."],"notes_en":["Pulse interval is 0.5s.","Total flight duration is 1.7 seconds of channel time + 0.8 of flight time.","Instantly recalls the Hammer on cast."],"specials":[{"key":"scepter_aura_duration","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.0],"percent":false,"values_scepter":[2.0]},{"key":"miss_rate","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.0],"percent":false,"values_scepter":[0.0]},{"key":"base_heal","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЛЕЧЕНИЕ ЗА ПУЛЬСАЦИЮ:","heading_en":"HEAL PER PULSE:","values":[45.0,70.0,95.0],"percent":false},{"key":"radius","system":false,"heading_ru":"РАДИУС ПРИЗЕМЛЕНИЯ:","heading_en":"LAND RADIUS:","values":[500.0],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_dawnbreaker_solar_guardian_radius","level":20,"op":"add","value":150,"values_with":[650.0]}]},{"key":"base_damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"УРОН ЗА ПУЛЬСАЦИЮ:","heading_en":"DAMAGE PER PULSE:","values":[30.0,50.0,70.0],"percent":false},{"key":"pulse_interval","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.5],"percent":false},{"key":"land_damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"УРОН ОТ ПРИЗЕМЛЕНИЯ:","heading_en":